      "source": "By default, set to \"true\" in which case cookie values are decoded.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，设置为 \"true\"，此时将解码 cookie 值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "use of <a href=\"../../../../../util/PathMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>PathMatcher</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../../util/UrlPathHelper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util\"><code>UrlPathHelper</code></a> is deprecated\nfor use at runtime in web modules in favor of parsed patterns with\n<a href=\"../../../../util/pattern/PathPatternParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util.pattern\"><code>PathPatternParser</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 `<a href=\"../../../../../util/PathMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>PathMatcher</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"../../../../util/UrlPathHelper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util\"><code>UrlPathHelper</code></a>` 在运行时于 Web 模块中已被弃用，转而使用由 `<a href=\"../../../../util/pattern/PathPatternParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util.pattern\"><code>PathPatternParser</code></a>` 解析的模式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <code>UrlPathHelper</code> to use to decode cookie values with via\n<a href=\"../../../../util/UrlPathHelper.html#decodeRequestString(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest,java.lang.String)\"><code>UrlPathHelper.decodeRequestString(HttpServletRequest, String)</code></a>.\nFor most cases you can use <a href=\"#setUrlDecode(boolean)\"><code>setUrlDecode(boolean)</code></a> instead.",
      "translation": "将 `<code>UrlPathHelper</code>` 设置为通过<a href=\"../../../../util/UrlPathHelper.html#decodeRequestString(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest,java.lang.String)\"><code>UrlPathHelper.decodeRequestString(HttpServletRequest, String)</code></a>解码 cookie 值。在大多数情况下，您可以使用<a href=\"#setUrlDecode(boolean)\"><code>setUrlDecode(boolean)</code></a>代替。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether to apply URL decoding to cookie values via\n<a href=\"../../../../util/UrlPathHelper.html#decodeRequestString(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest,java.lang.String)\"><code>UrlPathHelper.decodeRequestString(HttpServletRequest, String)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "是否通过 <a href=\"../../../../util/UrlPathHelper.html#decodeRequestString(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest,java.lang.String)\"><code>UrlPathHelper.decodeRequestString(HttpServletRequest, String)</code></a> 对 Cookie 值应用 URL 解码。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
